 end="00:38.600">Every </span><span begin="00:38.600" end="00:38.930">heart </span><span begin="00:38.930" end="00:39.110">that </span><span begin="00:39.110" end="00:39.200">I </span><span begin="00:39.200" end="00:39.500">held </span><span begin="00:39.500" end="00:40.160">before </span><span begin="00:40.160" end="00:40.250">I </span><span begin="00:40.250" end="00:40.370">was </span><span begin="00:40.370" end="00:40.700">sure </span><span begin="00:40.700" end="00:40.790">to </span><span begin="00:40.790" end="00:41.450">break </span><span begin="00:41.450" end="00:42.440">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.040" end="00:47.960"><span begin="00:43.040" end="00:43.220">I </span><span begin="00:43.220" end="00:43.520">don't </span><span begin="00:43.520" end="00:43.880">know </span><span begin="00:43.880" end="00:44.210">what </span><span begin="00:44.210" end="00:44.390">you </span><span begin="00:44.390" end="00:44.750">did </span><span begin="00:44.750" end="00:45.080">but </span><span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.290">I </span><span begin="00:45.290" end="00:45.770">just </span><span begin="00:45.770" end="00:46.820">can't </span><span begin="00:46.820" end="00:47.960">stop</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.140" end="00:50.090"><span begin="00:48.140" end="00:48.620">Thinking </span><span begin="00:48.620" end="00:49.010">about </span><span begin="00:49.010" end="00:49.250">you </span><span begin="00:49.250" end="00:49.790">every </span><span begin="00:49.790" end="00:50.090">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.090" end="00:54.440"><span begin="00:50.090" end="00:50.390">No </span><span begin="00:50.390" end="00:50.510">I </span><span begin="00:50.510" end="00:51.590">can't </span><span begin="00:51.590" end="00:52.580">stop </span><span begin="00:52.580" end="00:54.440">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.470" end="00:57.380"><span begin="00:54.470" end="00:54.830">Look </span><span begin="00:54.830" end="00:55.100">what </sp